{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Echo Extract",
    "steam_appid": 3366750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/21ce90d3b45209ac6f7a4b579ef8628e.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of weapons that you'll need to master to survive in combat.\u00a0 Each weapon comes with their own unique move list and mechanics.\u00a0 Throw and recall the giant Great Sword to extend combos, gain armor with the Warhammer, or teleport for quick counter-hits with the Light Dagger.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/2b9101127d954a83d98845a6d116f05c.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the land to find valuable loot and gear.\u00a0 You'll need this items for quests, crafting, and to sell on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ebbd314d03b55d86e064f5900b7e8e4b.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've gathered your loot you'll need to extract from the map.\u00a0 Be careful though, if you die on the map you'll lose everything you found!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/7efea652ce54e48a57630794d9873404.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home base is upgradable to your liking.\u00a0 This will unlock new weapons, stronger armor and helmets, and increase your characters stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ba085e600af3078edbd2c409a9c4d58c.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering your weapon, finding loot, extracting, and upgrading your base leads to one goal.\u00a0 Take out the gangs ruling the city and become the best bounty hunter in Nexus-8!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/21ce90d3b45209ac6f7a4b579ef8628e.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of weapons that you'll need to master to survive in combat.\u00a0 Each weapon comes with their own unique move list and mechanics.\u00a0 Throw and recall the giant Great Sword to extend combos, gain armor with the Warhammer, or teleport for quick counter-hits with the Light Dagger.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/2b9101127d954a83d98845a6d116f05c.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the land to find valuable loot and gear.\u00a0 You'll need this items for quests, crafting, and to sell on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ebbd314d03b55d86e064f5900b7e8e4b.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've gathered your loot you'll need to extract from the map.\u00a0 Be careful though, if you die on the map you'll lose everything you found!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/7efea652ce54e48a57630794d9873404.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home base is upgradable to your liking.\u00a0 This will unlock new weapons, stronger armor and helmets, and increase your characters stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ba085e600af3078edbd2c409a9c4d58c.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering your weapon, finding loot, extracting, and upgrading your base leads to one goal.\u00a0 Take out the gangs ruling the city and become the best bounty hunter in Nexus-8!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.poster.avif?t=1754699862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.webm?t=1754699862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Echo Extract is a single player, extraction, hack-and-slash! Master dozens of looted weapons, each with their own combo systems.\u00a0 Upgrade your home base with gear and items you've found in dangerous raids. Hunt high value targets and bring down the neon gangs to save the city.\u00a0",
